Main Tables and Description
1. User Table

Stores customer and admin information.

Fields:

User_ID (Primary Key)

Name

Email

Contact_Number

Password

Address

Role (User/Admin)

Purpose:
Manages user registration and login details.

2. Food Table

Stores details of food items.

Fields:

Food_ID (Primary Key)

Food_Name

Category

Price

Description

Availability_Status

Purpose:
Displays food menu to users.

3. Order Table

Stores order details.

Fields:

Order_ID (Primary Key)

User_ID (Foreign Key)

Order_Date

Total_Amount

Order_Status

Purpose:
Tracks customer orders.

4. Order_Details Table

Stores individual items in each order.

Fields:

Order_Detail_ID (Primary Key)

Order_ID (Foreign Key)

Food_ID (Foreign Key)

Quantity

Price

Purpose:
Manages multiple items in one order.

5. Payment Table

Stores payment information.

Fields:

Payment_ID (Primary Key)

Order_ID (Foreign Key)

Payment_Method

Payment_Status

Payment_Date

Purpose:
Handles payment records.

6. Delivery Table

Stores delivery status information.

Fields:

Delivery_ID (Primary Key)

Order_ID (Foreign Key)

Delivery_Address

Delivery_Status

Estimated_Time                                                                                                  